{
  "description": "Shared contract for how the gateway's baseline request events (pkg/plugins/gateway/tre_bl_req_events.go: blReissue, blInputTokens) classify the requests the reissue sidecar (tre/reissue/tre_reissue/sidecar.py) re-sends through the gateway. depth_header = the sidecar's Config.depth_header default. Each case is one request as it reaches the gateway: path, the x-tre-* request headers (all of them, names lower case) and the JSON body. from = client | sidecar_retry | sidecar_continue_completion | sidecar_continue_chat; the sidecar cases are recorded from the sidecar test harness (tre/reissue/tests/test_reissue_sidecar.py: test_gateway_reissue_contract re-creates each one and compares). reissue / in_tokens = the gateway's arr event fields.",
  "depth_header": "x-tre-reissue-depth",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "client_request",
      "from": "client",
      "path": "/v1/completions",
      "headers": {"x-tre-bl-in-tokens": "5"},
      "body": {"model": "m", "prompt": "one two three four", "max_tokens": 6, "temperature": 0, "stream": true, "stream_options": {"include_usage": true}},
      "reissue": "none",
      "in_tokens": 5
    },
    {
